      "error": "RuntimeError: FETCH_FAILURE: Page.goto: Timeout 25000ms exceeded.\nCall log:\n  - navigating to \"https://f"
    },
    "https://faculty.tamu.edu/JobDetail.aspx?PositionId=188642&JobId=190558": {
      "error": "RuntimeError: FETCH_FAILURE: Page.goto: net::ERR_NETWORK_CHANGED at https://faculty.tamu.edu/JobDetail.a"
